// VS Codeの拡張機能「Dev Containers」用設定
// docker-compose.yml からコンテナを起動するため、同時に開発サーバも立ち上がる
{
  "name": "Monst Dev Environment",
  "dockerComposeFile": "../docker-compose.yml",
  "service": "dev",
  "workspaceFolder": "/app",
  "customizations": {
    "vscode": {
      "extensions": [
        "Vue.volar",
        "dbaeumer.vscode-eslint",
        "esbenp.prettier-vscode"
      ]
    }
  },
  "postCreateCommand": "npm install"
}
